      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POSITIVE PENNY (2) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (44.46) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. WATCH MY SIX (5) latest effort finished 2nd over 600m at this track beaten 5 lengths (35.22) behind Tempting Dash in a Grade 5 on September 27. Can feature with the right run. ROM BARO (1) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish half a length away in second (41.54) at this track in a Grade 5/6 over 710m. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Will give a great sight again. GOT STYLE (4) is new to this distance but is worth considering.",
